   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "HandlingEventHub captures one immutable snapshot of subscribers before Raise iterates it, while a concurrent subscribe or unsubscribe swaps in a new snapshot without disturbing the notification already in flight.",
